[size=5][b]✦ For modders[/b][/size]

[font=Courier New]I.FairerWeaponAndMagicXP[/font] (player) has [font=Courier New]spellMultiplier(spellRecord)[/font], [font=Courier New]costMultiplier(cost)[/font], [font=Courier New]spellCost(spellRecord)[/font] and [font=Courier New]swingProfile(weapon)[/font]. The experience this mod adds reaches skill used handlers with no [font=Courier New]useType[/font] and a [font=Courier New]fairerWeaponAndMagicXP[/font] field saying where it came from ([font=Courier New]"miscast"[/font], [font=Courier New]"weaponHit"[/font], [font=Courier New]"miss"[/font], [font=Courier New]"boundWeapon"[/font], [font=Courier New]"boundArmor"[/font], [font=Courier New]"boundShield"[/font], [font=Courier New]"shield"[/font] or [font=Courier New]"elementalShield"[/font]). It also overrides [font=Courier New]I.Combat.pickRandomArmor[/font] on the player, passing everything through, to see which piece a hit lands on, and puts a small script on every NPC and creature that reports the player's attacks on them. How all of it works is in the [url=https://github.com/MaxYari/ArcanePracticeOpenMW/blob/main/Sources/DEVELOPMENT.md]technical notes[/url] in the git repository.
